graph LR
    A[输入数据
HDFS/S3] --> B[过滤 filter]
    B --> C[映射 map]
    C --> D[分组 groupByKey]
    D --> E[聚合 reduce]
    E --> F[输出结果]

    subgraph Stage1["Stage 1：窄依赖（可流水线执行）"]
        B
        C
    end

    subgraph Stage2["Stage 2：宽依赖（需要 Shuffle）"]
        D
        E
    end

    A -.-> Stage1
    Stage1 -.->|Shuffle| Stage2
    Stage2 -.-> F

    style Stage1 fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#2196f3
    style Stage2 fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ff9800
